<title>UK: IPE trading hours during Christmas and New Year.</title>
<headline>IPE trading hours during Christmas and New Year.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The International Petroleum Exchange (IPE) will trade the following hours over the Christmas and New Year holiday period.</p>
<p>    Monday 23 Dec    - Normal trading hours</p>
<p>    Tuesday 24 Dec   - 1230 GMT close</p>
<p>    Wednesday 25 Dec - Closed</p>
<p>    Thursday 26 Dec  - Closed</p>
<p>    Friday 27 Dec    - 1730 GMT close</p>
<p>    Monday 30 Dec    - Normal trading hours</p>
<p>    Tuesday 31 Dec   - 1230 GMT close</p>
<p>    Wednesday 1 Jan  - Closed</p>
<p>    Thursday 2 Jan   - Normal trading hours</p>
<p>--London newsroom 542 4984</p>
